The E6000 HVLP Airless® spray guns are designed with the latest technology to provide a high performing airless spraying system to the customer.
The new Siesta Plus HVLP spray gun with a new air filter, power-switching, and an anti-freeze spray feature. The Siesta Plus™ features easy cleanability and reliable cleaning. A new air filter offers an extended filter life. Switchable power feature will prevent accidental operation while cleaning. Anti-Freeze feature in the paint can will increase productivity by keeping the paint warm in cold temperatures. The anti-freeze spray will also enhance the painting process by improving adhesion. The paint can fits the standard Siesta HVLP spray gun and can be used for both exterior and interior painting tasks. The HDS-1350 (15.8lb water tank) will pump up to 1350lbs of air with a spray pressure of up to 150psi.Siesta Plus: {"ranked_products": ["HDS-1350","Siesta-55","Siesta-75","Siesta-90","Siesta-100","Siesta-110"]}
The HDS-1350 is a new high-performance airless paint sprayer. The new paint sprayer is easier to use with the intuitive touch screen control panel, it features more spray speeds and an advanced safety switch and anti-freeze feature. The paint sprayer is available in 11 or 13-lb water tanks and in 2 or 3-position spray modes with 3 spray speeds. The HDS-1350's durable, long lasting design allows the spray gun to paint up to twice the area in the same amount of time as a traditional airless paint sprayer. The spray gun can be connected with a hose and a paint sprayer pump. The spray gun features anti-tip legs and is operated in a safe and controlled manner. The spray gun features: The spray gun is easy to clean and will not cause excessive cleanup. The anti-tilt legs have built-in water spouts that will not leak when the spray gun is on. The easy on touch, screen screen display offers a wide range of spray programs and operation options. The LCD display will display the current spray program, pump speed and other information regarding the spray operation. The remote control offers a variety of spray operation modes,
